      "kind": "html",
      "html": "<p>Headless CMS, but what next? What about the front part? How to create a frontend which consumes that content, or even how to build omnichannel networks? In this talk, I will show you how to build maintainable enterprise applications using Strapi, Node.js as a backend for frontend, and React, all together inside a Kubernetes cluster.</p>"
